   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indirect questions and caution",
     "texto": [
      "Don't accept an isolated figure as a conclusion: look for who produced it, when and with what definition. Ask **Vet du hvilken undersøkelse tallet kommer fra?** («Do you know which survey the figure comes from?»). In an indirect question, keep the subject-verb order: **hvilken gruppe undersøkelsen gjelder** («which group the survey applies to»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
